# knob said once they settle, a button's message
wait 200
listen
wait 300
said Mix page, track DRONE: Level 60, Filter 0, LFO 30, Reverb 50. Piece
listen
where
said Scale D, E, F, G, A, Bb, C
tap SAVE
wait 300
said Envelope page, track DRONE
tap HOME
spin SELECT 4
tap SAVE
tap SAVE
wait 300
said Atmos sound page, character Wind
turn ALGO 2
wait 300
said Space
tap REC
wait 300
said HOLD
